== F2. sign-classification robustness ==
  min |defect| over relation-carrying CONNECTED classes at n<=4: 0.008284544000
  (six orders above the 1e-9 classification threshold and the 1e-13
   solver residual: the n=4 exhaustive classification is robust.)
  near-cancellation composite (2 triangles + w4, n=7, m=10):
    defect = +0.000037086421   prediction 2*tri + w4 = +0.000037086421   gap = 1.1e-16   res = 2.2e-16
  -> TOTAL defects of decomposable ledgers approach zero (here +3.7e-5);
     sign classification is only meaningful PER COMPONENT - one more
     reason the component law, not any global sign rule, is the physics.

